\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 5-BOJ unexpectedly eases policy as yen soars.  \b0\par\par\uc2 By Tamawa Kadoya  \par \uc2 812 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Oktober 2003\par 11:19\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2  TOKYO, Oct 10 (Reuters) - The Bank of Japan unexpectedly eased its already ultra-loose monetary policy on Friday, saying it would pump even more funds into the money market to give traction to Japan's nascent economic recovery.   \par \par \uc2  The decision - announced shortly after the government decided to go to the polls on November 9 - comes amid mounting concerns that the recent strengthening of the yen could choke off the economy's export-led recovery.   \par \par \uc2  BOJ Governor Toshihiko Fukui said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Policy Board members upgraded their assessment of the economy even as they voted to ease policy for the first time since May, stressing that the step was aimed at ensuring the recovery stayed on track.   \par \par \uc2  "On previous occasions where we raised the liquidity target, the measures were aimed at coping with downside risks to the economy. This time it is not aimed at coping with downside risk. We are upgrading our economic assessment.   \par \par \uc2  "As fragile as it may be, we are seeing early signs of a recovery, and we want to make it more solid," he said.   \par \par \uc2  Aiming to boost excess liquidity in the banking system, the BOJ said it would raise the upper end of its target range for current account deposits that banks keep at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to 32 trillion yen ($293.3 billion) from 30 trillion yen.   \par \par \uc2  The amount of deposits above banks' legally required reserves of about five trillion yen is almost entirely excess liquidity that earns zero interest for the banks. The BOJ hopes that by force-feeding them with cash, banks will increase lending and investment and prop up the economy.   \par \par \uc2  The easing decision - with three of the BOJ board's nine members dissenting - surprised financial markets.   \par \par \uc2  "I don't think anybody in the market expected this," said Makoto Yamashita, a strategist at UFJ Tsubasa Securities.   \par \par \uc2  YEN RALLY   \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market took the easing, along with gains in Tokyo stocks, as a sign of a strong recovery in Japan's economy, sending the yen to three-year highs around 108.65 to the dollar.   \par \par \uc2  Although Fukui said exchange rates were not the determining factor for the BOJ's decisions, the yen's rise - it's up some eight percent over the past month - adds to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's woes.   \par \par \uc2  A survey by the Ministry of Economy, Trade and Industry released on Friday showed that of 73 companies polled, 80 percent said their earnings and capital spending plans would suffer if the yen stayed above 110 to the dollar into next year.   \par \par \uc2  Analysts say the higher deposit target was due in part to technical factors stemming from the government's record \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  this year to try to stem the yen's surge.   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  conducted a record 13.5 trillion yen of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the first nine months of the year to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in check.   \par \par \uc2  Because the government's large-scale yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  effectively increases yen funds held by a limited number of banks, the BOJ has had to conduct complicated money market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  to evenly redistribute the funds while at the same time adhering to the 30 trillion yen ceiling.   \par \par \uc2  Fukui said the wider target range would allow the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to be more flexible in its market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2  He denied speculation that the higher deposit target, combined with the large-scale \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , amounted to so-called "unsterilised \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ".   \par \par \uc2  The BOJ normally drains extra yen funds in the private sector banking system that results from the government's yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . But BOJ critics have urged the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  not to do so and keep \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  "unsterilised", saying that would have a stronger impact on weakening the yen.   \par \par \uc2  Fukui also sought to calm anxiety in the bond market about when the BOJ would end the current monetary easing framework, known as "quantitative easing", saying he could not foresee conditions for such a change coming into place anytime soon.   \par \par \uc2  Speculation about an end to the easing policy has fuelled extreme volatility in the Japanese government bond market this year, with the yield on the benchmark 10-year bond quadrupling in a matter of weeks from a record low of 0.43 percent set in June.   \par \par \uc2  The BOJ has said its quantitative easing policy would end only after year-on-year changes in the consumer price index (CPI) stabilise above zero.   \par \par \uc2  On Friday, the BOJ issued a statement clarifying what "stabilise" meant. It said the CPI would have to rise for more than a few months and must not be expected to fall in the foreseeable future. Specifically, CPI forecasts by most Policy Board members must be above zero.   \par \par \uc2  Core CPI, excluding volatile fresh food prices, fell 0.1 percent in August from a year earlier, the 47th month of decline. ($1=109.11 yen).   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020031010dzaa000sc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
