\par\par \b \uc2 INSTANT VIEW-BOJ eases monetary policy.   \b0\par\par\uc2 223 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Oktober 2003\par 07:29\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2  TOKYO, Oct 10 (Reuters) - Following are immediate views of economists and analysts to an announcement by the Bank of Japan that it would ease monetary policy by expanding the high end of its reserves target to 32 trillion yen ($293.3 billion).    \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also decided to extend to one year the period in which it will buy Japanese government bonds (JGBs) under repurchase agreements - a move it had been considering since its last policy meeting.    \par \par \uc2  - - - -    \par \par \uc2  MAKOTO YAMASHITA, STRATEGIST, UFJ TSUBASA SECURITIES    \par \par \uc2  "I don't think anybody in the market expected this. Since \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily in September, they will need to absorb funds from the money market.    \par \par \uc2  "I think they wanted to avoid short-term interest rates from rising since they will likely need to increase fund-absorbing \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 .    \par \par \uc2  "The other purpose of course was trying to prevent a stronger yen by easing policy."    \par \par \uc2  - - - -    \par \par \uc2  KOJI SHIMAMOTO, CHIEF STRATEGIST AND HEAD OF INVESTMENT RESEARCH, BNP PARIBAS    \par \par \uc2  "I think the BOJ is showing its concern about the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market (stronger yen) and an uptrend in Japan's long-term interest rates. But this is not really a surprise as the BOJ has made similar moves in the past, which is to emphasise its commitment to accommodative monetary policy at the time of economic recovery."    \par \par \uc2  - - - -.    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020031010dzaa000pa\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw200\pich25\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3000\pichgoal375
