\par\par \b \uc2 Dollar slips, supported only by BOJ jitters.  \b0\par\par\uc2 520 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Oktober 2003\par 04:53\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     By Kazunori Takada\par  TOKYO, Oct 8 (Reuters) - The dollar fell on Wednesday, edging\par  towards three-year lows against the yen and 3-=   month lows\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 versus the euro as speculation intensified that U.S. and European authorities were prepared to see a weaker greenback.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 The dollar's losses were stemmed at 109.52 yen above 109.35 yen - its lowest level since November 2000 - hit on Tuesday, with traders citing rumours of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 "The market is nervous about \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  but almost all of the players are betting on a weaker dollar," said Mitsuru Sahara, vice president of the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealing group at UFJ Bank.  \par \par \uc2 "I have never seen the market this bearish on the dollar in 10 years."  \par \par \uc2 As of 0215 GMT, the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was at 109.65/68 yen compared with Tuesday's late New York levels around 109.90.  \par \par \uc2 The euro inched up to $1.1777/82 versus 1.1768/74, after rising to a 3-= month peak of around $1.1815 overnight.  \par \par \uc2 The dollar's weakness was almost universal, mired near seven-year lows against the Canadian dollar and six-year lows versus the Australian dollar.  \par \par \uc2 Japan's top financial diplomat, Zembei Mizoguchi, said that the decline in the dollar was caused by speculative movements and warned that Tokyo would take action as needed.  \par \par \uc2 But he declined to comment on suspected Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in New York on Tuesday after the dollar plunged to fresh lows.  \par \par \uc2 DOLLAR SEEN FALLING FURTHER  \par \par \uc2 Many traders in Tokyo say that Japanese officials could not reverse the dollar's downward trend single-handedly, given what appeared to be a laissez-faire policy among U.S. and European authorities on a weaker dollar. Washington was seen particularly concerned about the U.S. manufacturing industry.  \par \par \uc2 European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Wim Duisenberg's comments earlier this week that a weaker dollar was unavoidable, and U.S. President George W. Bush's remarks about \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  policies that offered "a level playing field" for U.S. companies, have fuelled views that the greenback was in for a long slide.  \par \par \uc2 "Clearly, these people are saying they will tolerate a weaker dollar," said Shogo Nagaya, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  manager at Nomura Trust & Banking.  \par \par \uc2 With U.S. Treasury Secretary John Snow expected to appear at a Senate hearing on global \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policies next week, and a meeting of Asia-Pacific Economic Cooperation in Bangkok later this month also offering a stage for Bush to put pressure on Asian nations on \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , traders said any rebound in the dollar would be limited.  \par \par \uc2 Nikkei stock prices fell 1.07 percent to 10,704.37 by the end of morning trade as investors dumped shares in exporters, spooked by the yen's jump.  \par \par \uc2 Still, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders think yen-buying pressure will remain strong.  \par \par \uc2 "People are now focusing on a weak dollar rather than a strong yen," said UFJ's Sahara.  \par \par \uc2 "If the Nikkei falls under 10,000, the yen could weaken. But unless such a situation occurs, I don't think stock prices will have any impact on the yen."   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020031008dza800080\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
