\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Dollar firms slightly, but jobs data weigh.  \b0\par\par\uc2 By Gertrude Chavez  \par \uc2 485 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Oktober 2003\par 23:02\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 NEW YORK, Oct 2 (Reuters) - The dollar firmed mildly against major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Thursday as traders grew cautious ahead of Friday's September U.S. employment report and bought the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the event of a strengthening in the jobs numbers.  \par \par \uc2 Markets were also wary in the aftermath of suspected yen-weakening Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  earlier in the global day.  \par \par \uc2 "We're having a bit of consolidation here, but the markets are basically focused on Friday's payrolls number," said Shaun Osborne, chief \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at Scotia Capital in Toronto.  \par \par \uc2 By late afternoon in New York, the euro fell 0.27 percent to $1.1684, with its bullish trend pretty much intact. Technicians expect the single European \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to retest its 2003 high of $1.1930.  \par \par \uc2 Against the yen , the dollar rose 0.15 percent to 110.73 yen. Against the Swiss franc , the dollar traded 0.26 percent higher at 1.3170 francs.  \par \par \uc2 The pound was nearly flat against the dollar at $1.6688.  \par \par \uc2 Filings for state jobless benefits rose to 399,000 in the week to Sept. 27, which were slightly above expectations.  \par \par \uc2 Analysts forecast that U.S. non-farm payroll jobs, slated for release on Friday, fell by 30,000 in September. The jobless rate forecast is 6.2 percent.  \par \par \uc2 LITTLE REACTION FROM FED SPEAKERS  \par \par \uc2 The dollar reacted little to a raft of U.S. Federal Reserve speakers on Thursday who downplayed concerns about the sustainability of the United States' economic recovery.  \par \par \uc2 Chicago Federal Reserve President Michael Moskow said solid demand would eventually lead to an employment pickup, while Philadelphia Federal Reserve President Anthony Santomero noted that the U.S. economy is gathering steam.  \par \par \uc2 Markets also remained on high alert for any potential BoJ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  as the dollar is nearing the key psychological level of 110 yen against the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 The greenback jumped about half a percent on the yen early in Asia and blipped up again later, with traders reporting BoJ action. The markets earlier buzzed with speculation \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  had tapped the Reserve Bank of Australia to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on its behalf.  \par \par \uc2 The Reserve Bank of Australia in New York declined to comment.  \par \par \uc2 A senior Japan \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  official also declined to comment on whether Tokyo had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 , saying it would only disclose its actions immediately if it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  through an overseas \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  - as it did through the Federal Reserve Bank of New York on Tuesday.  \par \par \uc2 "\b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is a hot topic" because of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's actions and officials' remarks this week, said Jeremy Fand, senior proprietary trader with WestLB in New York.  \par \par \uc2 Japanese authorities sold yen for dollars on Tuesday through the New York Fed in \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's first confirmed \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  since the Group of Seven major industrialized nations called for flexible \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates on Sept. 20. The action sent the dollar sharply higher.  \par \par \uc2 (Additional reporting by John Parry).   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020031002dza2004ci\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
